Fontport source provenance
==========================
The former src/fontlab_fontport/ui editors and feature-block helper
implementation have returned to fontlabapp/fontui in FontLab App. Fontport
retains only UI migration tombstones and the deprecated feature_blocks.py
forwarder. That code originated in FontLab App (fontlab-fontlabapp), originally
BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2022 Adam Twardoch. The same copyright owner relicenses and includes this code under
this repository's Apache License 2.0. See LICENSE for the licence terms.

The feature-block helpers in src/fontlab_fontport/feature_blocks.py were relocated
from FontLab App (fontlab-fontlabapp), originally BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c)
2022 Adam Twardoch. The same copyright owner relicenses and includes this code
under this repository's Apache License 2.0. See LICENSE for the licence terms.
Since issue 205 that module is only a forwarder to fontlabapp.fontui.feature_blocks.

The Qt editors (formerly src/fontlab_fontport/ui/*) moved back to
fontlab-fontlabapp as fontlabapp.fontui in issue 201 and are no longer part of
this repository.
